@startuml
title HTQLHDK - Trust boundaries and protected flows
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "TB-01 Client" {
  actor Browser
}
rectangle "TB-02 Edge" {
  component "Proxy / WAF" as Edge
}
rectangle "TB-03 Application" {
  component "Web/API" as API
  component "Worker" as Worker
}
rectangle "TB-04 Data" {
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  storage "Object storage" as OBJ
}
rectangle "TB-05 Security services" {
  component "IdP" as IDP
  component "KMS / Secrets" as KMS
}
rectangle "TB-06 Observability" {
  component "Telemetry" as TEL
}
rectangle "TB-07 Backup" {
  storage "Backup target" as BAK
}

Browser --> Edge : token/cookie, upload/download
Edge --> API : sanitized proxy request
API --> DB : business + audit transaction
Worker --> DB : durable jobs + results
API --> OBJ : staging/download
Worker --> OBJ : finalize/parse/export
API --> IDP : OIDC
API --> KMS : secret/key op
Worker --> KMS : key op
API --> TEL : allowlisted fields only
Worker --> TEL : allowlisted fields only
DB --> BAK : encrypted DB backup
OBJ --> BAK : encrypted object versions

note bottom of OBJ
Raw/evidence/export never public.
Generated keys; deny overwrite/delete.
end note
@enduml

